1
00:00:00,958 --> 00:00:05,250
Part 2: How to prevent mucositis.

2
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:07,041
As you start radiation,

3
00:00:07,041 --> 00:00:11,750
we would like for you to do
a set of rinses to help prevent mucositis.

4
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:15,083
The first thing we ask
is that you do this specific regimen

5
00:00:15,083 --> 00:00:18,625
that involves both baking soda and MuGard.

6
00:00:18,958 --> 00:00:21,541
Baking Soda: Rinse and spit.

7
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:25,708
We would like for you
to take a teaspoon of baking soda

8
00:00:25,708 --> 00:00:28,708
and mix it with eight ounces of water.

9
00:00:29,708 --> 00:00:30,958
You will then rinse your mouth

10
00:00:30,958 --> 00:00:33,958
for one minute and then spit it out.

11
00:00:34,583 --> 00:00:37,583
Do not swallow the baking soda.

12
00:00:38,458 --> 00:00:41,000
Mugard: Rinse and Swallow.

13
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,958
Immediately after the baking soda rinse,
we would like you to take a mouthful,

14
00:00:45,958 --> 00:00:49,375
5 to 10ml of MuGard and rinse your mouth

15
00:00:49,375 --> 00:00:52,750
for 30 seconds and then swallow it.

16
00:00:52,875 --> 00:00:55,416
The MuGard will not only protect your mouth,

17
00:00:55,416 --> 00:01:00,375
but it will also help protect your throat
and esophagus during treatment.

18
00:01:00,791 --> 00:01:03,291
The MuGard may not taste so pleasant,

19
00:01:03,291 --> 00:01:07,375
but it is well worth the benefits
and protection from radiation.

20
00:01:08,125 --> 00:01:09,166
We will provide you a

21
00:01:09,166 --> 00:01:12,583
bottle of the Mugard sample
on the first day of radiation.

22
00:01:12,958 --> 00:01:14,958
If you do not receive one.

23
00:01:14,958 --> 00:01:17,375
Please ask our nursing staff.

24
00:01:17,375 --> 00:01:20,125
We will also write you a prescription
for  MuGard

25
00:01:20,125 --> 00:01:22,625
that will be sent to your home.

26
00:01:22,625 --> 00:01:25,791
You may receive a call
from an out of state pharmacy,

27
00:01:25,791 --> 00:01:28,583
which is a specialty pharmacy
that will be asking you

28
00:01:28,583 --> 00:01:32,041
for information
on where to send your MuGard to.

29
00:01:32,333 --> 00:01:35,333
Please be sure to answer this call.

30
00:01:35,666 --> 00:01:38,958
Lastly, please be sure to do both baking

31
00:01:38,958 --> 00:01:43,291
soda and MuGard every day
at least twice a day.

32
00:01:43,416 --> 00:01:48,125
Your doctor may ask you to do it
more often, up to 4 to 5 times a day,

33
00:01:48,125 --> 00:01:52,041
especially if the mucositis is present
or worsening.

34
00:01:52,041 --> 00:01:56,833
We may also ask you to take a Q-Tip
and apply extra Mugard to the areas

35
00:01:56,833 --> 00:02:01,958
of mucositis, the specific white
spots on your tongue or mouth.

36
00:02:02,041 --> 00:02:04,125
If you do not have MuGard,

37
00:02:04,125 --> 00:02:07,125
please do not continue baking soda alone.

38
00:02:07,625 --> 00:02:11,708
Baking soda should only be done
right before the MuGard.
